- Notes: {{ $json.notes }}

Email requirements:
- Subject: clear confirmation with date and time
- Tone: warm, professional, reassuring
- Include all appointment details clearly
- What to bring: ID, insurance card, arrive 10 mins early
- Cancellation policy: cancel 24hrs before
- Clinic contact details placeholder: [CLINIC_PHONE] and [CLINIC_ADDRESS]
- Friendly closing

Respond with valid JSON only. No markdown, no backticks:
{
  "subject": "email subject",
  "body": "full email body with line breaks as \n"
}

parameters.jsCode:
let raw = $input.item.json.text || $input.item.json.output || '';
raw = raw.replace(/```json|```/g, '').trim();
try {
  const parsed = JSON.parse(raw);
  const booking = $('Parse Booking Data').item.json;
  return [{ json: { ...booking, subject: parsed.subject, body: parsed.body } }];
} catch(e) {
  return [{ json: { error: e.message, raw } }];
}

